#
# The plugins of the TacetOS firmware (docs/specs/firmware-branding.md, section 7).
# One plugin per line: its path in the plugins folder of the base build, without
# extension, then its TacetOS name when it is renamed. Only these plugins reach the
# zip; their overlays and data files go with them. Read by plugins.sh when the zip
# is made, and by check-build.sh --plugins.
#
# Left out on purpose: the test and developer tools, the Lua demo scripts, the voice
# announcer, the logo demo and the credits screen (section 7.2).

# Top of the plugins folder
